{"turn_id": "d07-t1", "session_id": "d07", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "feature_groups", "text": "该论文开发的语言学特征分为五个子组：基于长度的特征、词汇特征、形态特征、句法特征和语义特征。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-95d315be5888ab22f7efbd62"}]}, {"key": "feature_sources", "text": "这些特征是基于先前文献以及一本面向瑞典语L2学习者的语法书中的信息开发的。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-95d315be5888ab22f7efbd62"}]}, {"key": "length_features", "text": "基于长度的特征包括句子长度（以词元数和字符数计）、超长单词（长于十三个字符）以及传统瑞典语可读性公式LIX。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-95d315be5888ab22f7efbd62"}]}, {"key": "lexical_features", "text": "词汇特征使用Kelly词表信息（提供每个词元的CEFR等级和频率），采用每1000词的发生率分数，包括各CEFR等级词的发生率、高于文本或句子CEFR等级的词、不在Kelly词表中的词、未找到词元形式的词以及平均对数频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-95d315be5888ab22f7efbd62"}]}, {"key": "feature_combination_result", "text": "在句子层面，使用不同特征的组合比仅使用词汇特征使分类准确率提高了7%；而在文档层面，词汇特征更具主导性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-619fec3b6e7991135faaea3f"}, {"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-f16421f0ee652e6ad37ac288"}]}, {"key": "isolated_feature_performance", "text": "在文档层面实验中，单独使用基于长度、语义和句法特征的表现与基线相似或仅略好，而词汇特征具有较强的区分能力，仅用词汇特征达到约0.8 F值，接近完整特征集的0.81 F值。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-002c247f705e15494a446b37"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d07-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d07-t2", "session_id": "d07", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "model_and_overall_performance", "text": "论文提出了一个基于多种语言学特征的监督机器学习模型，用于对瑞典语第二语言学习材料进行5级复杂度分类，文档级模型取得81.3%的准确率和0.8的F值。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-619fec3b6e7991135faaea3f"}]}, {"key": "lix_unsuitability", "text": "论文指出传统的瑞典语可读性指标LIX不适用于该任务，LIX不仅准确率很低，还将91.6%的实例归为B2级别。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-002c247f705e15494a446b37"}]}, {"key": "document_level_isolated_features", "text": "在文档级实验中，基于长度、语义和句法特征单独使用时表现与基线相似或仅略好；而词汇特征具有较强的区分能力。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-002c247f705e15494a446b37"}]}, {"key": "document_level_lexical_vs_all", "text": "文档级上仅用词汇特征达到约0.8的F值，接近完整特征集的0.81，说明词汇信息单独即可在文档级区分课程教材的CEFR等级。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-002c247f705e15494a446b37"}]}, {"key": "document_level_accuracy_details", "text": "文档级使用完整特征集获得81%准确率和97%相邻准确率；仅用词汇特征时为80.3%准确率和98%相邻准确率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-002c247f705e15494a446b37"}]}, {"key": "classifier_choice", "text": "其他学习算法的准确率显著更低，因此论文后续只报告逻辑回归分类器的结果。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-002c247f705e15494a446b37"}]}, {"key": "sentence_level_performance", "text": "单独的句子级五类模型取得63.4%的准确率和92%的相邻准确率，低于文档级表现。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-619fec3b6e7991135faaea3f"}]}, {"key": "feature_combination_sentence_vs_document", "text": "在句子层面，使用不同特征的组合相比仅用词汇特征使分类准确率提升7%；而在文档层面词汇特征更具主导性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-619fec3b6e7991135faaea3f"}, {"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-f16421f0ee652e6ad37ac288"}]}, {"key": "sentence_level_vs_baselines", "text": "句子级模型使用完整特征集时，比多数类基线和LIX分别高出23%和22%，且超过一个等级的误分类不超过8%的句子。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-f16421f0ee652e6ad37ac288"}]}, {"key": "document_level_vs_lix_gain", "text": "与广泛使用的瑞典语可读性指标LIX相比，文档级模型在准确率和F值上分别提升46%和0.6。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-f16421f0ee652e6ad37ac288"}]}, {"key": "regression_comparability", "text": "为便于比较，论文还应用线性回归模型，得到0.8的相关系数和0.65的RMSE。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-002c247f705e15494a446b37"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d07-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
